{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25727","headline":"五月水边柳 · 张又新","name":"五月水边柳","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"结根挺涯涘，垂影覆清浅。\n睡脸寒未开，嬾腰晴更软。\n摇空条已重，拂水带方展。\n似醉烟景凝，如愁月露泫。\n丝长鱼悞恐，枝弱禽惊践。\n怅别几多情，含春任攀搴。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张又新","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25727.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25727","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}